### All talks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/talks

### One talk
GET http://localhost:8080/api/talks/1

### Find a talk by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/talks/search?title=JSON with Jackson 3

### The schedule feed for the mobile app
GET http://localhost:8080/api/talks/export

### Add a talk
POST http://localhost:8080/api/talks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Virtual Threads in Practice",
  "speaker": "Priya Patel",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-02T10:00:00",
  "room": "Room 101",
  "seats": 150
}

### Add a talk with no seat count
POST http://localhost:8080/api/talks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hallway Track",
  "speaker": "Everyone",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-02T12:00:00",
  "room": null,
  "seats": null
}

### H2 console
GET http://localhost:8080/h2-console

### The speaker for talk 1 (through Feign, with retries against a flaky API)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/talks/1/speaker

### Version 2.0 of the talks list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/talks
X-API-Version: 2.0

### A version we don't support
GET http://localhost:8080/api/talks
X-API-Version: 3.0
